    "updated_at": "2026-03-04T19:50:49Z",
    "body": "I don't think this is right, or I'm misunderstanding something.\nAt some point, the node is going to be adopted into the \"real\" document/tree-scope which has a real custom element registry.\nSetting a custom element registry on the inert document would make it so that, for example, custom element constructors would be called as a result of `createContextualFragment`.",
