    "updated_at": "2026-03-10T15:35:15Z",
    "body": "OK. I need to check again what issue I was having and get more details, because it makes sense that they shouldn't get upgraded until they're added to the real document. I wish I'd added a small repro case. 😅 \n\nIf I remember right the problem was that if the element already has a registry, this step erases it, and then it never gets set again when attached to the real document. But I may have that wrong.",
